{"model": "medium.en", "slug": "C_S03E04", "language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.16, "text": "-Didn't they say 3-0-4? -No, 3-0-3. I wrote it down twice."}, {"start": 3.16, "end": 4.6, "text": "[ Knock on door ]"}, {"start": 4.6, "end": 7.0, "text": "-♪♪ Let's try an Abish new apartment ♪♪"}, {"start": 7.0, "end": 10.64, "text": "-Hi!"}, {"start": 10.64, "end": 14.28, "text": "-Come on in. Come on. -Okay, wow."}, {"start": 14.28, "end": 15.88, "text": "What a great place."}, {"start": 15.88, "end": 18.08, "text": "You guys -- You guys look so fancy."}, {"start": 18.08, "end": 20.42, "text": "-Thanks. We read a book on how to be the perfect party host."}, {"start": 20.42, "end": 21.68, "text": "Rule number one -- dress to impress."}, {"start": 21.68, "end": 25.52, "text": "-Rule number two -- avoid touchy topics like the Negro problem."}, {"start": 25.52, "end": 27.16, "text": "The book was written in the '40s."}, {"start": 27.16, "end": 29.76, "text": "- Yeah. - Oh, good. You guys are finally here."}, {"start": 29.76, "end": 32.0, "text": "- Finally? - Shirley showed up at 3."}, {"start": 32.0, "end": 35.14, "text": "- Time flies when I'm baking. - No, it doesn't."}, {"start": 35.14, "end": 37.84, "text": "- Oh, the door downstairs was propped open with this."}, {"start": 37.84, "end": 38.84, "text": "This is really unsafe."}, {"start": 38.84, "end": 40.84, "text": "Anyone could've just wandered into your building."}, {"start": 40.84, "end": 41.84, "text": "[buzzer buzzes]"}, {"start": 41.84, "end": 43.84, "text": "- Like one of our guests? - I'll be right back."}, {"start": 43.84, "end": 44.58, "text": "- Thank you, Troy."}, {"start": 44.58, "end": 46.18, "text": "Let me give you ladies the grand tour."}, {"start": 46.18, "end": 47.08, "text": "Bathroom, kitchen, who cares?"}, {"start": 47.08, "end": 49.48, "text": "And this is my scale model of the \"Rolling Boulder\" scene"}, {"start": 49.48, "end": 52.02, "text": "from \"Raiders\" with actual \"Rolling Boulder.\""}, {"start": 52.02, "end": 53.26, "text": "- Ooh. - Yeah."}, {"start": 53.26, "end": 55.92, "text": "- Adios, Peter. - Oh."}, {"start": 55.92, "end": 56.92, "text": "Pretty cool, huh?"}, {"start": 56.92, "end": 58.92, "text": "Super cool and sexy."}, {"start": 58.92, "end": 60.92, "text": "Super sexy cool."}, {"start": 60.92, "end": 61.92, "text": "Oh, for selling it."}, {"start": 61.92, "end": 63.92, "text": "I made pizza."}, {"start": 63.92, "end": 64.92, "text": "But we ordered real pizza."}, {"start": 64.92, "end": 66.92, "text": "Well, there's nothing more real than homemade."}, {"start": 66.92, "end": 67.92, "text": "You didn't have some of the ingredients,"}, {"start": 67.92, "end": 70.92, "text": "so I used ketchup and cream cheese."}, {"start": 70.92, "end": 72.92, "text": "We ordered real pizza."}, {"start": 72.92, "end": 74.92, "text": "Oh, my bad."}, {"start": 75.92, "end": 76.92, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 76.92, "end": 78.92, "text": "Hey, I got you that."}, {"start": 80.92, "end": 83.92, "text": "Bienvenido de la Casa Chez Pro Bed."}, {"start": 83.92, "end": 84.92, "text": "Very nice."}, {"start": 84.92, "end": 86.92, "text": "- Very nice. - Oh, look."}, {"start": 87.0, "end": 89.72, "text": "Indiana Jones in the apartment of perpetual virginity."}, {"start": 89.8, "end": 91.26, "text": "[laughs]"}, {"start": 91.34, "end": 94.26, "text": "Chop-busted, fellow adult. Chop-busted."}, {"start": 94.34, "end": 97.76, "text": "It's nice. Not mansion-nice, but it's nice."}, {"start": 97.84, "end": 99.76, "text": "Didn't you used to live in a mansion with me?"}, {"start": 99.84, "end": 102.14, "text": "Yeah, but this is more my speed and century."}, {"start": 102.22, "end": 104.4, "text": "Doesn't bother me. I've hardly missed you at all"}, {"start": 104.48, "end": 106.44, "text": "since I had you removed from my portraits."}, {"start": 106.52, "end": 109.28, "text": "Jeff, check it out. Serbian rum."}, {"start": 109.36, "end": 112.24, "text": "So strong, it is banned there."}, {"start": 112.32, "end": 115.52, "text": "And in Serbia, Jeff."}, {"start": 115.52, "end": 117.12, "text": "Let that concept sink in."}, {"start": 117.12, "end": 118.2, "text": "Yeah, well, you enjoy."}, {"start": 118.2, "end": 119.36, "text": "I have to leave early. - Oh?"}, {"start": 119.36, "end": 120.32, "text": "Yeah, sorry."}, {"start": 120.32, "end": 122.72, "text": "I've got an invite to the opening of a new club."}, {"start": 122.72, "end": 123.74, "text": "Look at this place."}, {"start": 123.74, "end": 124.96, "text": "Looks like it was designed for me."}, {"start": 124.96, "end": 125.64, "text": "It was."}, {"start": 125.64, "end": 127.24, "text": "I made that in Photoshop and made it to you a month ago"}, {"start": 127.24, "end": 129.24, "text": "so that you'd keep tonight open on your calendar."}, {"start": 129.24, "end": 130.96, "text": "There's no such thing as single malt platinum"}, {"start": 130.96, "end": 134.56, "text": "boobs and billiards club?"}, {"start": 134.56, "end": 136.28, "text": "I guess I never said it out loud."}, {"start": 136.28, "end": 138.56, "text": "Tonight, we offer something far more than boobs and billiards."}, {"start": 138.56, "end": 139.36, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 139.36, "end": 141.24, "text": "One word, two syllables."}, {"start": 141.24, "end": 142.96, "text": "- Don't say charades."}, {"start": 142.96, "end": 143.8, "text": "- Yahtzee!"}, {"start": 145.28, "end": 147.4, "text": "- Is charades off the table?"}, {"start": 147.4, "end": 150.84, "text": "♪ Give me some more time in a dream ♪"}, {"start": 150.84, "end": 154.06, "text": "♪ Give me the hope to run out of steam ♪"}, {"start": 154.06, "end": 155.88, "text": "♪ Somebody say ♪"}, {"start": 155.88, "end": 157.48, "text": "♪ We could be here ♪"}, {"start": 157.48, "end": 161.52, "text": "♪ We could be roped up, tied up, dead in a year ♪"}, {"start": 161.52, "end": 166.44, "text": "♪ I can't count the reasons I should stay