regnancy test look like?"}, {"start": 237.82, "end": 239.26, "text": "- It looks like a thin piece of plastic"}, {"start": 239.26, "end": 240.26, "text": "with a thing on the end of it."}, {"start": 240.26, "end": 242.14, "text": "- Okay, so this is definitely a gun."}, {"start": 242.14, "end": 244.42, "text": "- Whoa, yeah, put that away."}, {"start": 244.42, "end": 245.9, "text": "- Why does Annie have a gun?"}, {"start": 245.9, "end": 248.14, "text": "- That's not a gun, that's a girl's pea shooter."}, {"start": 248.14, "end": 250.7, "text": "Here, Troy, happy housewarming."}, {"start": 251.62, "end": 253.3, "text": "- Jeff, what are we gonna do about this?"}, {"start": 253.3, "end": 254.5, "text": "- I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 255.38, "end": 257.1, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 257.1, "end": 259.72, "text": "Funny. I don't know. People are getting their heads up."}, {"start": 259.8, "end": 261.26, "text": "Don't fight him with him."}, {"start": 263.64, "end": 265.18, "text": "Well, you can fight a little."}, {"start": 266.26, "end": 267.26, "text": "Smells weird."}, {"start": 267.72, "end": 270.22, "text": "-I beg your pardon? -Smells weird. What did you do?"}, {"start": 270.3, "end": 272.98, "text": "Abed, you don't ask someone a question like that."}, {"start": 273.06, "end": 274.56, "text": "It's not dignified."}, {"start": 275.4, "end": 276.64, "text": "Pizza!"}, {"start": 276.72, "end": 278.64, "text": "Pizza, pizza, going tummy."}, {"start": 278.72, "end": 280.98, "text": "Me so hungry, me so hungry."}, {"start": 281.06, "end": 282.94, "text": "Pizza guy was super creepy."}, {"start": 283.02, "end": 284.64, "text": "So you're saying he was a pizza guy?"}, {"start": 287.1, "end": 288.9, "text": "I wonder what happened in those other timelines."}, {"start": 288.9, "end": 291.94, "text": "Abed, there are no other timelines."}, {"start": 291.94, "end": 294.32, "text": "[ Buzzer ]"}, {"start": 294.32, "end": 295.62, "text": "Ugh. Okay."}, {"start": 