 one in an airplane bathroom"}, {"start": 466.88, "end": 468.74, "text": "when Eartha Kitt decided to bang me."}, {"start": 468.74, "end": 470.26, "text": "- Oh, shit! - Oh, what?"}, {"start": 470.26, "end": 471.54, "text": "- That's where my mind went."}, {"start": 471.54, "end": 472.96, "text": "- Your mind went years ago."}, {"start": 476.92, "end": 478.96, "text": "- I'm gonna check on my pies."}, {"start": 478.96, "end": 480.3, "text": "- Ah, Seth! - No!"}, {"start": 482.0, "end": 482.96, "text": "- Bathroom?"}, {"start": 482.96, "end": 484.4, "text": "- Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 484.4, "end": 486.24, "text": "- I love your place, Troy."}, {"start": 486.24, "end": 488.48, "text": "You're all grown up now."}, {"start": 488.48, "end": 489.32, "text": "- Man, I can't believe"}, {"start": 489.32, "end": 491.94, "text": "those are real mahogany bunk beds in there."}, {"start": 491.94, "end": 495.86, "text": "I'll bet that cost you a few allowances."}, {"start": 495.86, "end": 498.6, "text": "- Oh, Troy. - Now we've done it."}, {"start": 499.7, "end": 500.54, "text": "- Everybody's in the back."}, {"start": 500.54, "end": 501.36, "text": "- Adios."}, {"start": 506.36, "end": 507.2, "text": "- Who is it?"}, {"start": 507.2, "end": 508.04, "text": "- Troy."}, {"start": 508.04, "end": 510.2, "text": "- (coughs) I'm washing my hands."}, {"start": 510.2, "end": 512.52, "text": "- Good, then I can come in."}, {"start": 512.52, "end": 513.36, "text": "- Oh, hi."}, {"start": 515.58, "end": 517.62, "text": "I was smoking a cigarette."}, {"start": 517.62, "end": 519.2, "text": "- I know what you were doing."}, {"start": 519.2, "end": 520.82, "text": "I'm 21 years old."}, {"start": 520.82, "end": 521.66, "text": "I'm a man."}, {"start": 521.94, "end": 522.94, "text": "Oh, OK."}, {"start": 528.6, "end": 530.42, "text": "I know that."}, {"start": 530.42, "end": 531.42, "text": "We all know that."}, {"start": 531.42, "end": 534.54, "text": "Then why is Jeff always picking on me?"}, {"start": 534.54, "end": 536.72, "text": "You seem to be a little hard on Troy lately."}, {"start": 536.72, "end": 537.82, "text": "I'm going to get a drink."}, {"start": 537.82, "end": 538.72, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 538.72, "end": 540.38, "text": "Oh my god, are you OK?"}, {"start": 540.38, "end": 541.28, "text": "Barely felt it."}, {"start": 541.28, "end": 542.36, "text": "Well, let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 542.36, "end": 543.26, "text": "It is in the bathroom."}, {"start": 543.26, "end": 544.16, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 544.16, "end": 545.06, "text": "Um."}, {"start": 548.06, "end": 549.42, "text": "Oh no, what happened?"}, {"start": 549.42, "end": 550.54, "text": "A minor head wound."}, {"start": 550.54, "end": 551.38, "text": "- If there's an abrasion,"}, {"start": 551.38, "end": 553.06, "text": "we'll clean it with iodine and apply ice."}, {"start": 553.06, "end": 554.42, "text": "- You make a good nurse."}, {"start": 554.42, "end": 555.26, "text": "- Thanks."}, {"start": 555.26, "end": 557.38, "text": "- Dr. Shirley says mini pies are the best medicine."}, {"start": 557.38, "end": 558.98, "text": "- Then I'd like to see her degree."}, {"start": 560.02, "end": 562.62, "text": "- He's budding antlers with you because you're a threat now."}, {"start": 562.62, "end": 565.28, "text": "You've got your own place, you've got a future,"}, {"start": 565.28, "end": 569.02, "text": "you've got a bowl full of olives next to the toilet."}, {"start": 569.02, "end": 570.94, "text": "- It's a fancy party, Britta."}, {"start": 570.94, "end": 573.56, "text": "- You know what Jeff has in his bathroom?"}, {"start": 573.56, "end": 574.62, "text": "Neither do I."}, {"start": 574.62, "end": 578.5, "text": "He keeps his toiletries in a safe under the sink."}, {"start": 578.5, "end": 581.86, "text": "His whole personality is based around guarding himself."}, {"start": 581.86, "end": 583.94, "text": "You don't have to be like that to be a man."}, {"start": 586.62, "end": 588.02, "text": "- You're really cool, Berta."}, {"start": 589.22, "end": 592.14, "text": "- Man, pizza guys are getting worse and worse looking."}, {"start": 592.14, "end": 594.46, "text": "Guess all the good ones went into porn."}, {"start": 594.46, "end": 595.74, "text": "- Ceiling fan."}, {"start": 595.74, "end": 596.9, "text": "- I miss all the fun."}, {"start": 596.9, "end": 598.58, "text": "- I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 598.58, "end": 600.0, "text": "- Who cares? - Who cares?"}, {"start": 605.0, "end": 607.14, "text": "(buzzer buzzing)"}, {"start": 607.14, "end": 609.78, "text": "Okay, starting on my left with one,"}, {"start": 609.78, "end": 611.18, "text": "your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 611.18, "end": 612.38, "text": "- Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating"}, {"start": 612.38, "end": 613.34, "text": "six different timelines."}, {"start": 613.34, "end": 614.62, "text": "- Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 619.26, "end": 621.86, "text": "Six, one, two, three, four, five, six, Britta."}, {"start": 621.86, "end": 623.02, "text": "- Great."}, {"start": 623.02, "end": 623.86, "text": "- Great."}, {"start": 623.86, "end": 624.9, "text": "You know what's great?"}, {"start": 624.9, "end": 626.22, "text": "Air travel."}, {"start": 626.22, "end": 629.06, "text": "I've flown a lot, a lot of airplane stories."}, {"start": 629.06, "end": 630.38, "text": "I once had sex with Eartha Kitt."}, {"start": 630.38, "end": 632.22, "text": "- Okay, I'm gonna check on my pies."}, {"start": 637.14, "end": 640.74, "text": "-You guys are my best. -I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 640.74, "end": 642.84, "text": "-Ow! -Oh, my God."}, {"start": 642.84, "end": 644.54, "text": "-Are you okay? -Barely felt it."}, {"start": 644.54, "end": 648.18, "text": "-Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 648.18, "end": 649.92, "text": "-Did I need to refill the toilet olives?"}, {"start": 649.92, "end": 651.48, "text": "-We're good. I checked. -You're the best."}, {"start": 651.48, "end": 653.62, "text": "-Want to stay up all night talking to our bunk beds?"}, {"start": 653.62, "end": 654.42, "text": "-Do-do-y."}, {"start": 654.42, "end": 657.16, "text": "-Here, Troy. Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 657.16, "end": 660.46, "text": "-Oh, cool. Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 660.46, "end": 662.3, "text": "-You make a good nurse, Annie."}, {"start": 662.3, "end": 665.56, "text": "-Thank you. I actually had to apply a tourniquet"}, {"start": 665.56, "end": 667.94, "text": "- I had to apply a tourniquet the other day."}, {"start": 667.94, "end": 669.86, "text": "The guy got stabbed outside my building."}, {"start": 669.86, "end": 670.7, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 670.7, "end": 673.02, "text": "Annie, you gotta get the hell out of that apartment."}, {"start": 673.02, "end": 675.62, "text": "- You don't have to treat me like a kid anymore, remember?"}, {"start": 675.62, "end": 678.9, "text": "- Yeah, but adults still need to be protected."}, {"start": 678.9, "end": 681.14, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 682.26, "end": 683.26, "text": "You important to me."}, {"start": 687.02, "end": 687.84, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 687.84, "end": 692.02, "text": "- Fear the terror, fear the terror, fear the terror!"}, {"start": 692.02, "end": 693.36, "text": "Norwegian troll!"}, {"start": 693.36, "end": 694.86, "text": "- What's going on in here?"}, {"start": 694.86, "end": 696.42, "text": "- Here's to terrorizing Troy because he's jealous"}, {"start": 696.42, "end": 697.26, "text": "when we moved in together."}, {"start": 697.26, "end": 698.34, "text": "- You're the one who's jealous."}, {"start": 698.34, "end": 699.18, "text": "- Why would I be jealous?"}, {"start": 699.18, "end": 701.48, "text": "- Because you're lonely and crazy."}, {"start": 707.18, "end": 710.48, "text": "- Hey guys, this is Toby, our pizza delivery guy,"}, {"start": 710.48, "end": 712.34, "text": "and I know this is gonna sound nuts,"}, {"start": 712.34, "end": 715.08, "text": "but we're in love and we're getting married."}, {"start": 722.42, "end": 724.34, "text": "- I wonder what happened on all those other timelines."}, {"start": 724.34, "end": 727.66, "text": "- Wait, there are other timelines?"}, {"start": 727.66, "end": 729.5, "text": "(buzzer)"}, {"start": 729.5, "end": 730.66, "text": "- Ah, okay."}, {"start": 730.66, "end": 732.5, "text": "Starting on my left with one,"}, {"start": 732.5, "end": 733.9, "text": "your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 733.9, "end": 734.74, "text": "- Just so you know, Jeff,"}, {"start": 734.74, "end": 736.02, "text": "you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 736.02, "end": 737.42, "text": "- Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 742.02, "end": 743.48, "text": "One, Troy."}, {"start": 743.48, "end": 745.26, "text": "- Damn it, I'm gonna go as fast as I can"}, {"start": 745.26, "end": 746.52, "text": "so I don't miss anything."}, {"start": 750.52, "end": 752.46, "text": "- You know who I used to call miss anything?"}, {"start": 752.46, "end": 753.3, "text": "Eartha Kitt."}, {"start": 753.3, "end": 755.84, "text": "Oh, my God. He totally set that up."}, {"start": 755.92, "end": 758.26, "text": "I'm checking on my pies."}, {"start": 758.34, "end": 760.76, "text": "- Russ! - No."}, {"start": 760.84, "end": 763.76, "text": "- Bathroom? - Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 763.84, "end": 767.06, "text": "Jeff, tell us about your father. I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 767.14, "end": 769.06, "text": "- Ow! - Oh, my God. Are you okay?"}, {"start": 769.14, "end": 772.1, "text": "- I barely felt it. - Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 773.24, "end": 775.06, "text": "Ah! Ahh!"}, {"start": 778.32, "end": 781.2, "text": "- Ahh! Ahh! Ahh! - What the hell?"}, {"start": 781.28, "end": 783.6, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 785.6, "end": 789.4, "text": "- Call 911, Ormond, help me stop the bleeding."}, {"start": 789.4, "end": 791.74, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 791.74, "end": 793.74, "text": "- I'm dying, I am dying."}, {"start": 797.08, "end": 798.78, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 798.78, "end": 802.42, "text": "- Water, water, water, water, water, please."}, {"start": 803.42, "end": 805.74, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 811.28, "end": 813.82, "text": "-I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!"}, {"start": 813.82, "end": 816.32, "text": "-I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!"}, {"start": 816.32, "end": 819.52, "text": "-[ Screaming ]"}, {"start": 819.52, "end": 821.12, "text": "[ Buzzer ]"}, {"start": 821.12, "end": 822.46, "text": "-Ah, okay."}, {"start": 822.46, "end": 825.6, "text": "Starting on my left with 1, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 825.6, "end": 826.8, "text": "-Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating"}, {"start": 826.8, "end": 827.76, "text": "six different timelines."}, {"start": 827.76, "end": 829.3, "text": "-Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 836.3, "end": 838.38, "text": "-5. 1, 2, 3, 4, 5."}, {"start": 838.38, "end": 839.38, "text": "Abed. -I'm on it."}, {"start": 839.38, "end": 840.78, "text": "-You know who else was on it?"}, {"start": 840.78, "end": 842.88, "text": "- And? - Do you know what it is?"}, {"start": 842.88, "end": 844.58, "text": "Everybody give me money."}, {"start": 844.58, "end": 848.92, "text": "Oh, that mascot really softens your personality."}, {"start": 848.92, "end": 851.68, "text": "I banged her at the kid."}, {"start": 851.68, "end": 854.72, "text": "- Russ! - No!"}, {"start": 854.72, "end": 857.26, "text": "- Bathroom? - Down the hall."}, {"start": 860.26, "end": 861.9, "text": "You mean drinking."}, {"start": 861.9, "end": 864.36, "text": "- Ow! - Oh, my God, are you okay?"}, {"start": 864.36, "end": 866.2, "text": "- I barely felt it. - Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 866.2, "end": 868.1, "text": "- Where is it in the bathroom? - Oh."}, {"start": 868.1, "end": 868.94, "text": "- Oh."}, {"start": 871.94, "end": 873.28, "text": "- Oh no, what happened?"}, {"start": 873.28, "end": 875.04, "text": "- A minor head wound."}, {"start": 876.44, "end": 877.78, "text": "- Oh my God."}, {"start": 877.78, "end": 878.78, "text": "What smells amazing?"}, {"start": 878.78, "end": 881.78, "text": "- Oh, someone wants pie!"}, {"start": 881.78, "end": 882.78, "text": "- You ain't a good nurse."}, {"start": 882.78, "end": 885.46, "text": "(Pierce giggles)"}, {"start": 886.66, "end": 888.12, "text": "- Oh my God."}, {"start": 888.12, "end": 890.42, "text": "They taste just like regular-sized pies."}, {"start": 890.42, "end": 891.8, "text": "- Oh, yay!"}, {"start": 891.8, "end": 893.14, "text": "- Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 893.14, "end": 894.84, "text": "- Oh, cool."}, {"start": 894.84, "end": 896.1, "text": "Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 897.14, "end": 900.14, "text": "Hey, while we're alone, I just wanted to say thanks for letting me live with you."}, {"start": 900.22, "end": 904.26, "text": "Sometimes I feel like making desserts is the only thing I'm good for in the group."}, {"start": 904.34, "end": 907.52, "text": "But now it's time for me to try and make it on my own."}, {"start": 907.6, "end": 909.4, "text": "Just like you did."}, {"start": 909.48, "end": 910.94, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 911.02, "end": 913.82, "text": "- I don't think you should open it. - No. What? What are you talking about?"}, {"start": 913.9, "end": 916.2, "text": "You're very important to me."}, {"start": 916.28, "end": 919.5, "text": "Crap. I was not supposed to eat your stuff. We all made an agreement."}, {"start": 919.58, "end": 921.96, "text": "Crap. I was not supposed to say that out loud."}, {"start": 922.04, "end": 924.88, "text": "Crap! Okay. Cards on the table. I'm really high right now."}, {"start": 924.96, "end": 926.92, "text": "[ Sighs ]"}, {"start": 926.92, "end": 929.66, "text": "Seriously, I -- No, I want to give you something else."}, {"start": 929.66, "end": 932.5, "text": "A water pick. A speedboat. Two water picks."}, {"start": 932.5, "end": 935.5, "text": "I can't believe I'm feeding my pies to a drug addict!"}, {"start": 935.5, "end": 937.84, "text": "Drug addict?! You're a pie pusher!"}, {"start": 937.84, "end": 940.18, "text": "You push pies to get love!"}, {"start": 940.18, "end": 941.8, "text": "Give it, Pierce! Stop it!"}, {"start": 941.8, "end": 944.18, "text": "It feels fun!"}, {"start": 944.18, "end": 947.98, "text": "I'm sorry. I just had a weird déjà vu."}, {"start": 947.98, "end": 949.56, "text": "You're bad at gift-giving!"}, {"start": 949.56, "end": 952.02, "text": "That thing you said about worrying about me?"}, {"start": 952.02, "end": 953.78, "text": "Something my dad always said."}, {"start": 953.78, "end": 955.78, "text": "I demand to be house-warmed!"}, {"start": 955.78, "end": 957.78, "text": "I shouldn't have brought it up."}, {"start": 957.78, "end": 959.78, "text": "It just reminded me of my dad."}, {"start": 959.78, "end": 960.78, "text": "Anyway..."}, {"start": 960.78, "end": 963.78, "text": "A little make-out 101, less dad talk,"}, {"start": 963.78, "end": 966.78, "text": "and you could ease up on the bubblegum lip gloss."}, {"start": 966.78, "end": 967.78, "text": "No, I really don't..."}, {"start": 967.78, "end": 969.78, "text": "No, you..."}, {"start": 972.78, "end": 973.78, "text": "Pizza time!"}, {"start": 973.78, "end": 976.78, "text": "Give me this, you godless hippie skank!"}, {"start": 976.78, "end": 978.78, "text": "You're a sick, sad, twisted old man,"}, {"start": 978.78, "end": 980.78, "text": "and I hope you die alone."}, {"start": 980.78, "end": 981.78, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 983.78, "end": 986.42, "text": "-I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 986.42, "end": 990.42, "text": "♪♪♪♪"}, {"start": 990.42, "end": 991.92, "text": "I got to say, I hope this is the real one,"}, {"start": 991.92, "end": 994.26, "text": "because I just found a nickel in the hallway."}, {"start": 994.26, "end": 997.7, "text": "♪♪♪♪"}, {"start": 997.7, "end": 999.06, "text": "[ Buzzer ]"}, {"start": 999.06, "end": 999.8, "text": "-Ah, okay."}, {"start": 999.8, "end": 1003.04, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 1003.04, "end": 1004.74, "text": "-Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating"}, {"start": 1004.74, "end": 1008.24, "text": "six different timelines. -Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 1008.24, "end": 1012.64, "text": "♪♪♪♪"}, {"start": 1012.64, "end": 1014.54, "text": "- I don't think you should."}, {"start": 1016.4, "end": 1018.36, "text": "Chaos already dominates enough of our lives."}, {"start": 1018.36, "end": 1021.02, "text": "The universe is an endless raging sea of randomness."}, {"start": 1021.02, "end": 1023.52, "text": "Our job isn't to fight it, but to weather it together"}, {"start": 1023.52, "end": 1025.48, "text": "on the raft of life, a raft held together"}, {"start": 1025.48, "end": 1027.44, "text": "by those few, rare, beautiful things"}, {"start": 1027.44, "end": 1028.76, "text": "that we know to be predictable."}, {"start": 1028.76, "end": 1030.5, "text": "- Ropes, vines."}, {"start": 1030.5, "end": 1031.34, "text": "- Vines?"}, {"start": 1031.34, "end": 1032.62, "text": "- Let him finish!"}, {"start": 1032.62, "end": 1033.46, "text": "- Us."}, {"start": 1034.6, "end": 1035.54, "text": "It won't matter what happens to us"}, {"start": 1035.54, "end": 1036.76, "text": "as long as we stay honest in accepting"}, {"start": 1036.76, "end": 1038.8, "text": "of each other's flaws and virtues."}, {"start": 1038.8, "end": 1039.94, "text": "Annie will always be driven."}, {"start": 1039.94, "end": 1041.22, "text": "Shirley will always be giving."}, {"start": 1041.22, "end": 1042.34, "text": "Pierce will never apologize."}, {"start": 1042.34, "end": 1046.5, "text": "It's sort of a wild card from my perspective and Jeff will forever remain a conniving son of a bitch"}, {"start": 1047.48, "end": 1052.04, "text": "There are six sides to this die and seven of us. He devised a system by which he never has to get the pizza"}, {"start": 1055.7, "end": 1063.58, "text": "Pretty low dude, it's called friendship. Look it up and Carter it. I think we just found our pizza getting"}, {"start": 1065.84, "end": 1067.84, "text": "Like it matters who goes"}, {"start": 1072.34, "end": 1075.86, "text": "That guy sucks harder than the toilet and an airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1075.94, "end": 1078.98, "text": "- Airplane bathroom. - Oh, my pies."}, {"start": 1079.06, "end": 1081.94, "text": "- ♪ Roxanne ♪ - Oh!"}, {"start": 1082.02, "end": 1085.82, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1085.9, "end": 1089.86, "text": "♪ Those days are over ♪"}, {"start": 1089.94, "end": 1093.06, "text": "♪ You don't have to sell your money to the night ♪"}, {"start": 1093.14, "end": 1096.7, "text": "- ♪ Roxanne ♪ - I really love your plays."}, {"start": 1096.78, "end": 1098.7, "text": "You should move here."}, {"start": 1098.78, "end": 1101.7, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1101.78, "end": 1108.92, "text": "Walk the streets for money, you don't care if it's wrong or if it's right."}, {"start": 1108.92, "end": 1116.04, "text": "Roxanne, you don't have to put on the red light."}, {"start": 1116.04, "end": 1119.56, "text": "You gotta see what happens when I leave you alone, huh?"}, {"start": 1119.56, "end": 1123.0, "text": "You don't have to put on the red light."}, {"start": 1123.0, "end": 1124.0, "text": "Roxanne."}, {"start": 1124.0, "end": 1126.48, "text": "Put on the red light."}, {"start": 1126.48, "end": 1127.48, "text": "Roxanne."}, {"start": 1127.48, "end": 1129.46, "text": "Put on the red light."}, {"start": 1129.46, "end": 1130.46, "text": "Don't try."}, {"start": 1130.46, "end": 1133.76, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1133.76, "end": 1137.0, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1139.44, "end": 1142.38, "text": "- To Pierce, may he rest in Pierce."}, {"start": 1144.58, "end": 1146.76, "text": "- Shirley, don't you think you've had enough?"}, {"start": 1146.76, "end": 1147.6, "text": "- Of you?"}, {"start": 1148.76, "end": 1150.6, "text": "Guys, I've been thinking about that night over and over."}, {"start": 1150.6, "end": 1151.96, "text": "One thing has become clear."}, {"start": 1151.96, "end": 1153.8, "text": "This is the darkest, most terrible timeline."}, {"start": 1153.8, "end": 1156.72, "text": "- Enough with the timeline, crap, Abed."}, {"start": 1156.72, "end": 1159.12, "text": "Pierce got shot in the leg and died."}, {"start": 1159.12, "end": 1161.88, "text": "Shirley's a drunk and he's locked in a mental ward"}, {"start": 1161.88, "end": 1164.06, "text": "because her guilt drove her insane."}, {"start": 1164.06, "end": 1166.22, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire."}, {"start": 1166.22, "end": 1169.74, "text": "Troy lost his larynx because for some dumb reason"}, {"start": 1169.74, "end": 1172.94, "text": "he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it."}, {"start": 1172.94, "end": 1174.62, "text": "- Clearly you don't understand anything"}, {"start": 1174.62, "end": 1175.82, "text": "about the teenage bros."}, {"start": 1175.82, "end": 1178.98, "text": "- Life has gone to hell, Abed."}, {"start": 1178.98, "end": 1180.3, "text": "This is real."}, {"start": 1180.3, "end": 1181.94, "text": "Look at us, look at me."}, {"start": 1181.94, "end": 1185.02, "text": "- Britta, you put one washed away blue streak in your hair"}, {"start": 1185.02, "end": 1186.98, "text": "and I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1186.98, "end": 1189.14, "text": "- Exactly, life got dark."}, {"start": 1189.14, "end": 1190.34, "text": "- All because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.34, "end": 1192.5, "text": "- Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.5, "end": 1193.48, "text": "- It's mine."}, {"start": 1193.48, "end": 1194.98, "text": "I've run through that night over and over in my head"}, {"start": 1194.98, "end": 1196.46, "text": "and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.46, "end": 1199.04, "text": "I should have caught the die and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1199.04, "end": 1201.18, "text": "I failed to do that and we all suffered for it."}, {"start": 1201.18, "end": 1202.68, "text": "But I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 1205.0, "end": 1205.84, "text": "- What is this?"}, {"start": 1205.84, "end": 1207.62, "text": "- Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest,"}, {"start": 1207.62, "end": 1209.66, "text": "which is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.66, "end": 1211.1, "text": "I've made us all black goatees out of felt."}, {"start": 1211.1, "end": 1213.5, "text": "I suggest you put 'em on until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1215.06, "end": 1217.3, "text": "From now on, I'm Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1217.3, "end": 1220.42, "text": "We are the Evil Study Group, and we have but one evil goal."}, {"start": 1220.42, "end": 1222.2, "text": "Return somehow to the prime timeline,"}, {"start": 1222.2, "end": 1223.86, "text": "the one that I stopped you from rolling that die,"}, {"start": 1223.86, "end": 1225.34, "text": "then we destroy the good versions of ourselves"}, {"start": 1225.34, "end": 1226.8, "text": "and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1228.46, "end": 1230.98, "text": "- Evil Abed, as Evil Jeff,"}, {"start": 1230.98, "end": 1232.9, "text": "am I allowed to pull fewer punches with you?"}, {"start": 1232.9, "end": 1233.74, "text": "- Certainly."}, {"start": 1233.74, "end": 1234.86, "text": "- I hate you!"}, {"start": 1234.86, "end": 1236.58, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap!"}, {"start": 1236.58, "end": 1241.02, "text": "I lost my damn arm, and you're making fake beards!"}, {"start": 1241.02, "end": 1241.86, "text": "- Go tease."}, {"start": 1245.06, "end": 1263.54, "text": "Evil Troy and Evil Abed!"}, {"start": 1263.54, "end": 1264.54, "text": "What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1264.54, "end": 1265.54, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 1265.54, "end": 1265.54, "text": "I guess nothin'."}, {"start": 1275.06, "end": 1277.64, "text": "(upbeat music)"}]}